    <briefdescription>
<para>MessagePack object, represented as a tagged union of C++ types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All types except <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1msgpack_1afdae9da66bac09f4b2bfc0fd9f0559e6a4da8b7eb2c3f2007cf8238334401ef51" kindref="member">Type::Nil</ref></computeroutput> (which has only one value, and so is completely represented by the <computeroutput>Kind</computeroutput> itself) map to a exactly one union member. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
